    "q-155535": {
      "dom_id": "step-q155535",
      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "The parabola $y={x}^{2}+3x-1$ and the line $y=-3x-10$ intersect at a single point with coordinates $(p,q).$ What is $p+q?$",
      "worked_solution": "We need to solve the following system consisting of the equations of the curves:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}y={x}^{2}+3x-1 \\\\ y=-3x-10\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSetting the equations equal to one another and solving, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}+3x-1 & =-3x-10 \\\\ {x}^{2}+3x-1+3x+10 & =0 \\\\ {x}^{2}+6x+9 & =0 \\\\ (x+3)(x+3) & =0 \\\\ x & =-3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the $x$-coordinate of the intersection point is $x=-3.$ \n\nTo find the $y$-coordinate of the intersection point, we plug this value into either curve. \nLet's choose the equation of the line. Substituting $x=-3,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =-3x-10 \\\\  & =-3(-3)-10 \\\\  & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the only point of intersection is $(-3,-1).$ Therefore, $p=-3,\\,q=-1,$ and \n\n$$\np+q=-3+(-1)=-4.\n$$\n\nA sketch of the situation is shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14250393/assets/91bedb41cd1b30cf392b23c0986e7b191ecf170fbdd4a0c34f5e2b8977c747b2.png)",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-155535-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "4",
              "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"56\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>"
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-155535-b",
